## Attribution

Minevlayer is a wrapper over PrismarineJS/mineflayer.
It does not replace or hide the original work — it builds on top of it.

- Original project: https://github.com/PrismarineJS/mineflayer (MIT, by Andrew Kelley and PrismarineJS contributors)
- This wrapper (src/, MinevlayerBot API, examples): (MIT, by vlalikoffc)

You can use the underlying Mineflayer API directly via `minevlayer.mineflayerCore` or `require('./lib/loader')` if you need low-level control.
See https://github.com/PrismarineJS/mineflayer for the original documentation.
